=\"（陳順禎 攝）\"><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260517/1132658019889582080369871.jpeg/38CpqoMqvb47jtnRyK2GcFG-UPpHM9_gP6SLOgWkizo\" alt=\"（陳順禎 攝）\"><figcaption>（陳順禎 攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-17T06:41:09.069996+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":955,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}